PR #897 — "Product image gallery" (AI-generated)
Description: the product page shows up to 12 photos as thumbnails; clicking one shows it large. A missing image should show a placeholder. Timed review: 15 minutes.

diff --git a/src/components/Gallery.tsx b/src/components/Gallery.tsx
new file mode 100644
